row(5, 31, 'MATERIAL', f'AND YOU, STAND HERE WITH ME, AND I WILL SPEAK TO YOU ALL THE COMMANDMENT AND THE STATUTES AND THE JUDGMENTS WHICH YOU SHALL TEACH THEM, THAT THEY MAY DO THEM IN THE LAND WHICH I GIVE THEM TO POSSESS. {HP(5, 31, (("ואתה", "פה", "עמד", "עמדי"), "AND YOU, HERE STAND WITH ME — one seat: THE SIFREI 357:40 (fresh, below) — Moses prophesied only STANDING, Balaam fallen; \'with me\' twenty Torah seats (computed)"), (("ואדברה", "אליך"), "and I will speak to you — 5:31 and 2 Samuel 20:16 (computed)"), (("את", "כל", "המצוה", "והחקים", "והמשפטים"), "ALL THE COMMANDMENT AND THE STATUTES AND THE JUDGMENTS — one seat; 6:1 the same three without \'all\'; \'all the commandment\' eight in the book (computed)"), (("אשר", "תלמדם", "ועשו", "בארץ"), "which you shall teach them, that they may do in the land — one seat each (computed)"), (("אשר", "אנכי", "נתן", "להם", "לרשתה"), "which I give them to possess — one seat (computed)"))} → {AP(5, 31, (("ואת", "הכא", "קים", "קדמי", "ואמלל", "עמך"), "and you, here stand BEFORE ME and I will speak with you — \'with me\' made \'before me\' (one seat) (computed)"), (("ית", "כל", "תפקדתא", "וקימיא", "ודיניא"), "all the commandment and the statutes and the judgments — \'the commandment\' thirteen seats in the book (computed)"))}. THE REGISTER: the LORD\'s "I" (ואדברה, "and I will speak"; אנכי נתן, "I give") inside Moses\' report — the code\'s author speaking; the compile reads 5:31 as the charge that makes 6:1-onward Moses\' teaching of what was spoken here (the block\'s edge).')
